			"widgets_values":[
				"The underwater martial arts battle scene is created with the quality of a film. The camera pans down from the water surface, focusing on the fighting posture of the black-clad female warrior in the clear water waves. Her long hair flows freely with the water flow, like a black silk thread entwining the light and shadow. Her hand holding the long sword has visible veins, and when the blade cuts through the water, the water splashes are captured in slow motion to present the exquisite details. The crystalline water droplets freeze in an instant, and the surrounding golden fallen leaves float slowly with the dark current, creating an Eastern martial arts atmosphere that combines hardness and softness. The light is created by the underwater refraction to create a hazy and layered effect. Close-up shots capture the focused expression on the face and the details of the hand gripping the sword, making each swing of the sword have both a sense of power and poetry. It recreates the strength and visual impact of the classic martial arts film \"The Water Duel\", constructing an immersive combat dynamic and showcasing the solitary yet fierce martial arts combat aesthetics."
			],
